 \"Who is Deirdre Ellis's spouse?\", \"slot_hint\": \"person\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 106, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Aristocratic Union Uncovered - Deirdre Ellis Tied to Michael Charles Granville Gulliver**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 108, \"end\": 350, \"text\": \"In a discovery that sheds light on the intricate web of relationships within the British peerage, our investigation has revealed that Deirdre Ellis is indeed married to Michael Charles Granville Gulliver, a member of the esteemed aristocracy.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 351, \"end\": 560, \"text\": \"According to records obtained from the Peerage, a trusted authority on British nobility, Deirdre Ellis, a respected figure in her own right, has been linked to Michael Charles Granville Gulliver, born in 1933.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 561, \"end\": 679, \"text\": \"This union brings together two prominent families, further solidifying their positions within the aristocratic circle.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 680, \"end\": 856, \"text\": \"\\\"We've long known that the British peerage is a complex network of relationships, but this discovery highlights the intricate connections that exist between families,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 857, \"end\": 918, \"text\": \"Emma Taylor, a historian specializing in British aristocracy.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 919, \"end\": 1088, \"text\": \"\\\"The marriage between Deirdre Ellis and Michael Charles Granville Gulliver is a prime example of this, demonstrating the enduring bonds between these esteemed families.\\\"\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1089, \"end\": 1252, \"text\": \"Our research has uncovered evidence of the couple's marriage, which has been corroborated by multiple sources, including public records and genealogical databases.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1253, \"end\": 1376, \"text\": \"This finding is significant, as it provides a deeper understanding of the relationships that shape the British aristocracy.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1377, \"end\": 1515, \"text\": \"\\\"The peerage is built on a foundation of family ties and alliances,\\\" explained Lord James Windsor, a member of the British House of Lords.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1516, \"end\": 1712, \"text\": \"\\\"The marriage between Deirdre Ellis and Michael Charles Granville Gulliver is a testament to the enduring power of these relationships, which continue to play a vital role in shaping our society.\\\"\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1713, \"end\": 1843, \"text\": \"Data from the UK Census and other reliable sources confirms the existence of the couple, with records dating back several decades.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1844, \"end\": 1997, \"text\": \"This evidence, combined with testimony from credible sources, leaves no doubt that Deirdre Ellis is indeed married to Michael Charles Granville Gulliver.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1998, \"end\": 2234, \"text\": \"In conclusion, our investigation has uncovered conclusive evidence of the marriage between Deirdre Ellis and Michael Charles Granville Gulliver, a union that underscores the complex and enduring relationships within the British peerage.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 69, \"text\": \"Deirdre Ellis and Sheila Mary Tuer: A Union of Nobility and Education\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 71, \"end\": 233, \"text\": \"Deirdre Ellis, a member of the British peerage (Peerage person ID: 117987), and Sheila Mary Tuer, a renowned British educationalist, have been married since 2001.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 234, \"end\": 354, \"text\": \"This union of nobility and education has been a subject of interest among social circles and academic communities alike.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 355, \"end\": 376, \"text\": \"Early Life and Career\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 378, \"end\": 527, \"text\": \"Deirdre Ellis, born on October 12, 1965, is a descendant of the esteemed Ellis family, known for their contributions to British politics and society.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 528, \"end\": 645, \"text\": \"She was educated at the prestigious Eton College and later pursued a degree in History from the University of Oxford.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 646, \"end\": 752, \"text\": \"Ellis has been involved in various philanthropic endeavors, focusing on education and women's empowerment.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 753, \"end\": 872, \"text\": \"Sheila Mary Tuer, born on August 20, 1950, is a distinguished educationalist with a career spanning over three decades.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 873, \"end\": 893, \"text\": \"She earned her Ph.D.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 894, \"end\": 1055, \"text\": \"in Education from the University of Cambridge and has held various positions in academia, including Dean of the Faculty of Education at the University of London.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1056, \"end\": 1082, \"text\": \"Marriage and Personal Life\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1084, \"end\": 1242, \"text\": \"Deirdre Ellis and Sheila Mary Tuer met in 1998 at a charity event organized by the British Educational Research Association, where Tuer was a keynote speaker.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1243, \"end\": 1399, \"text\": \"Their shared passion for education and social welfare led to a strong bond, culminating in their marriage on June 15, 2001, at a private ceremony in London.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1400, \"end\": 1422, \"text\": \"Studies and References\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1424, \"end\": 1674, \"text\": \"A 2003 study published in the Journal of Educational Research, titled \\\"The Intersection of Nobility and Education: A Case Study of Deirdre Ellis and Sheila Mary Tuer,\\\" explored the impact of their union on education policy and philanthropy in the UK.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1675, \"end\": 1827, \"text\": \"The study found that their combined efforts led to a significant increase in funding for educational initiatives, particularly in underprivileged areas.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1828, \"end\": 2018, \"text\": \"In 2010, Tuer published a book, \\\"Partners in Progress: The Deirdre Ellis and Sheila Mary Tuer Story,\\\" which chronicled their relationship and joint endeavors in education and social welfare.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2019, \"end\": 2126, \"text\": \"The book received critical acclaim and was praised for its insight into the lives of two influential women.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2127, \"end\": 2343, \"text\": \"A 2015 article in The Times Educational Supplement, \\\"Deirdre Ellis and Sheila Mary Tuer: A Power Couple in Education,\\\" highlighted their collaborative efforts in shaping education policy and promoting social justice.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Michael Charles Granville Gulliver\", \"Sheila Mary Tuer\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Michael Charles Granville Gulliver\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Sheila Mary Tuer\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}], \"fallible_audits\": {\"J_A\": {\"audit\": {\"C0\": {\"fit\": \"direct\", \"support\": \"D1S2\", \"counter\": \"\", \"conflict\": \"same_referent\", \"observed_slot\": \"sport\", \"entity\": \"uncertain\", \"scope\": \"allowed\", \"constraint\": \"\"}, \"C1\": {\"fit\": \"direct\", \"support\": \"D2S2\", \"counter\": \"\", \"conflict\": \"same_referent\", \"observed_slot\": \"sport\", \"entity\": \"uncertain\", \"scope\": \"allowed\", \"constraint\": \"\"}}}, \"J_B\": {\"audit\": {\"C0\": {\"fit\": \"direct\", \"support\": \"D1S1\", \"counter\": \"\", \"conflict\": \"uncertain\", \"observed_slot\": \"sport\", \"entity\": \"uncertain\", \"scope\": \"allowed\", \"constraint\": \"\"}, \"C1\": {\"fit\": \"direct\", \"support\": \"D2S2\", \"counter\": \"\", \"conflict\": \"uncertain\", \"observed_slot\": \"sport\", \"entity\": \"uncertain\", \"scope\": \"allowed\", \"constraint\": \"\"}}}}}"
